    "subheading": "Roma Film Production is a luxury wedding cinematography and photography atelier.",
    "leadParagraph": "Founded with an unrelenting pursuit of visual perfection, Roma Film Production curates authentic, emotionally resonant imagery for discerning couples worldwide. We merge medium-format editorial portraiture with high-frame-rate cinema.",
